# Project Atlas

Atlas is a fictional project exploring how a team can retrieve and reuse durable knowledge.

## Current focus

- make important context discoverable;
- preserve why decisions were made;
- keep operating procedures close to the work;
- test retrieval using [[Research notes: Retrieval quality]].

